        "Content": "Bright two-bedroom apartment in a secure gated development\r\nSpacious living and dining room with feature fireplace\r\nPrivate balcony overlooking North Brunswick Street\r\nSeparate fitted kitchen with integrated and freestanding appliances\r\nRefurbished (2023) shower room with vanity unit and heated towel rail\r\nLift access\r\nElectric heating\r\nLandscaped communal courtyards, recreation court and communal roof terrace\r\nSmithfield Luas stop approximately 9 minutes' walk\r\nTU Dublin Grangegorman approximately 11 minutes' walk\r\nSmithfield and Stoneybatter cafés, restaurants and shops close by\r\nPhoenix Park and the National Museum at Collins Barracks within easy reach\r\nConvenient access to the city centre, Heuston Station, Connolly Station and Busáras"
